{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1367814-world-anvil-or-other-campaign-design-tools","id":1367814,"title":"World Anvil or other campaign design tools?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-14T11:16:16-08:00","id":1367814,"title":"World Anvil or other campaign design tools?","content":"Do you have any experience using campaign design tools, such as World Anvil, to help you with your campaign? Whether that's personal planning and organization, or public presentation of campaign information, or as a player interacting with such, I'd love to hear about your experiences and recommendations.<br /> <br /> I'm looking for something myself to help me keep it all sorted and inspire the mood. There are a lot of options out there! I used to use Obsidian Portal, but I'm looking for something with more helpful tools.<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZinR2EXjdSmNAlIoj0eVUtNW61dvSgz-45XyKTOQt4g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">VtR 2v5 Homebrew: VtR 2e base with my favorite V5 mechanics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/241-nicodemus","name":"nicodemus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar241_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-14T18:04:08-08:00","id":1367938,"title":"","content":"I've used World Anvil, mostly because the setup for the various pages helps me with organizing my thoughts in the building process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-n